    {
      "id": "gmail",
      "display_name": "Gmail",
      "description": "Read, search, send, draft, and label Gmail messages through the Gmail API. Requires a Google Cloud OAuth 2.0 credentials file (~/.gmail-mcp/gcp-oauth.keys.json). The install dialog includes a step-by-step guided setup \u2014 no command-line work needed.",
