      "warning": "One-time Google Cloud setup required. The install dialog will guide you through creating an OAuth 2.0 client in the Google Cloud Console and placing the credentials file in ~/.gmail-mcp/. After install the server opens a browser sign-in once to authorize access (credentials cached at ~/.gmail-mcp/credentials.json). First npm fetch can take 10\u201320 s.",
      "primary_auth": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "outlook",
